ROOT_DET_LOWER_AXIOMS D1Bound5.scaledRootMatrix_det_norm_identity: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
ROOT_DET_LOWER_AXIOMS D1Bound5.scaledRootMatrix_det_norm_lower: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
